Pictures of other work

The pictures in src/originals and public/img show other work. They are not
under this license. Each keeps the copyright and the license of the work it
shows.

The game pictures show Updraft, SumUp, Sudoku, WoodLogic, Forkline and Fair
Deal Solitaire. The app pictures show ScaleConnect, Board Game Collector and
MapApp. Each belongs to its own project, under that project's license.

The MapApp pictures also show map data, which keeps its own licenses:
OpenStreetMap data under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0, USDA NAIP
imagery in the public domain, and parcel data from Macon County, Illinois
GIS, which is based on assessment information and is not a legal survey.

The pictures in the web folders show bartbasi.com, crackerscheese.com,
cupm.net and financeillinois.com. Each site belongs to its owner.


Third party parts

freeplayinc.org uses three fonts, each under the SIL Open Font License,
version 1.1: Anybody, Instrument Sans and Doto. Their licenses are in
public/fonts/OFL-Anybody.txt, public/fonts/OFL-Instrument-Sans.txt and
